00:34:32.308 --> 00:34:33.875
- Dammit!
- What? What?

278
00:34:34.908 --> 00:34:36.075
Stupid punk!

279
00:34:36.975 --> 00:34:38.258
Did you breathe into my neck?

280
00:34:38.342 --> 00:34:41.108
Are you nuts?
You stink.

281
00:34:42.542 --> 00:34:45.175
Someone definitely
breathed into my neck!

282
00:34:46.708 --> 00:34:48.575
What was that?

283
00:34:50.575 --> 00:34:51.458
Hang on.

284
00:34:51.542 --> 00:34:53.262
We have to shoot something
to win the prize.

285
00:34:54.208 --> 00:34:58.375
We definitely heard
a strange noise.

286
00:34:58.908 --> 00:35:00.808
Could it be Kim Seok-ho?

287
00:35:02.608 --> 00:35:05.275
Holy...

288
00:35:06.642 --> 00:35:07.642
This is crazy.

289
00:35:08.742 --> 00:35:11.642
Something's definitely in there.

290
00:35:12.742 --> 00:35:13.742
Guys.

291
00:35:14.542 --> 00:35:16.280
If we get something,

292
00:35:16.364 --> 00:35:17.824
we'll win grand prize for sure.

293
00:35:17.908 --> 00:35:20.608
- Yeah, grand prize.
- You idiots...

294
00:35:22.775 --> 00:35:24.675
Hey, Hye-young! Hey!

295
00:35:29.575 --> 00:35:31.791
You idiot, what's with you?

296
00:35:31.875 --> 00:35:33.424
I told you,

297
00:35:33.508 --> 00:35:35.142
we shouldn't be here any longer!

298
00:35:36.108 --> 00:35:38.175
Then you should've
stopped us from the beginning.

299
00:35:42.608 --> 00:35:43.608
Hey...

300
00:35:43.908 --> 00:35:44.942
Hye-young!

301
00:35:47.842 --> 00:35:49.491
You scared the crap out of me!

302
00:35:49.575 --> 00:35:50.575
Hey!

303
00:35:51.708 --> 00:35:53.058
What? You nuts?

304
00:35:53.142 --> 00:35:55.308
What are you doing alone?

305
00:35:56.242 --> 00:35:57.575
You chickens.

306
00:35:59.475 --> 00:36:00.508
Take a look.

307
00:36:05.942 --> 00:36:08.075
That was it?

308
00:36:11.275 --> 00:36:12.875
You guys are so funny.

309
00:36:13.342 --> 00:36:16.975
Didn't you just tease me
for getting scared?

310
00:36:18.508 --> 00:36:21.042
But there's...

311
00:36:22.375 --> 00:36:23.375
no draft here.

312
00:36:30.242 --> 00:36:31.242
What?

313
00:36:44.875 --> 00:36:45.875
What is it?

314
00:36:46.308 --> 00:36:47.308
Someone...

315
00:36:47.375 --> 00:36:49.124
Someone breathed down
my neck now again.

316
00:36:49.208 --> 00:36:50.975
I heard a laugh
right beside me too.

317
00:36:51.942 --> 00:36:52.991
You heard it wrong.

318
00:36:53.075 --> 00:36:53.924
I didn't!

319
00:36:54.008 --> 00:36:56.008
Let's get out of here!

320
00:36:59.808 --> 00:37:00.808
Guys...

321
00:37:01.275 --> 00:37:02.275
What?

322
00:37:02.542 --> 00:37:04.175
- What's wrong?
- What is it?

323
00:37:05.675 --> 00:37:07.075
Hye-young...

324
00:37:10.175 --> 00:37:11.842
What the heck is it?

325
00:37:21.675 --> 00:37:23.175
What was that?

326
00:37:24.508 --> 00:37:26.458
It was a ghost!

327
00:37:26.542 --> 00:37:27.942
Shut the heck up!

328
00:37:34.075 --> 00:37:37.291
Hye-young! It's us.

329
00:37:37.375 --> 00:37:38.575
Snap out of it!

330
00:37:51.608 --> 00:37:53.275
You disloyal punks.

331
00:37:53.608 --> 00:37:55.875
Are you even my friends?

332
00:37:56.408 --> 00:37:58.475
My camera...

333
00:37:59.942 --> 00:38:01.775
Where's my camera?

334
00:38:09.775 --> 00:38:11.275
Do you know
how expensive that is?

335
00:38:11.642 --> 00:38:13.258
You can't get it in Korea!

336
00:38:13.342 --> 00:38:14.742
Forget about your camera.

337
00:38:15.175 --> 00:38:17.142
Let's just leave!

338
00:38:19.908 --> 00:38:21.042
Hey! Dude!

339
00:38:21.308 --> 00:38:22.708
My camera!

340
00:38:23.275 --> 00:38:24.675
Seriously? Hey!

341
00:38:25.242 --> 00:38:27.158
- Wait for me.
- Come on, man!

342
00:38:27.242 --> 00:38:28.624
Get down here!

343
00:38:28.708 --> 00:38:31.608
Won-jae, get down here!

344
00:38:52.942 --> 00:38:55.108
Damn.
What the heck?

345
00:38:59.108 --> 00:39:00.561
We're stuck here,

346
00:39:00.645 --> 00:39:02.675
just like
what the graffiti said...

347
00:39:03.042 --> 00:39:06.975
We ran down here,
but we're in 2nd floor again!

348
00:39:07.542 --> 00:39:09.591
It could be our delusion.

349
00:39:09.675 --> 00:39:11.358
Or we didn't see
the floor number...

350
00:39:11.442 --> 00:39:12.842
We kept walking down.

351
00:39:13.675 --> 00:39:15.642
- I know we'll all die here.
- What the heck?

352
00:39:19.608 --> 00:39:21.008
What the heck?

353
00:39:26.408 --> 00:39:28.858
Won-jae, why are you here?

354
00:39:28.942 --> 00:39:30.524
I should be asking you that!

355
00:39:30.608 --> 00:39:33.124
Damn, I'm sure we came down
from the 2nd floor!

356
00:39:33.208 --> 00:39:34.608
Guys...

357
00:39:35.408 --> 00:39:36.528
There's something in here...

358
00:39:36.608 --> 00:39:38.575
I heard voices! Ours!

359
00:39:44.242 --> 00:39:45.308
Damn...

360
00:39:47.208 --> 00:39:48.208
What's that?

361
00:39:59.475 --> 00:40:00.708
Idiots...

362
00:40:01.308 --> 00:40:03.124
I should have been careful.
Goddammit.

363
00:40:03.208 --> 00:40:04.675
Now they know.

364
00:40:12.642 --> 00:40:13.642
What was that?

365
00:40:21.675 --> 00:40:22.858
Won-jae, come on!

366
00:40:22.942 --> 00:40:24.408
Get over here!

367
00:40:25.075 --> 00:40:26.142
Dammit...

368
00:40:27.875 --> 00:40:30.191
The dimensions are intertwined?

369
00:40:30.275 --> 00:40:31.891
Come on, prick!

370
00:40:31.975 --> 00:40:33.175
Hey, Won-jae!

371
00:40:35.075 --> 00:40:36.075
Who are you?

372
00:40:37.875 --> 00:40:38.875
Answer me.

373
00:40:40.342 --> 00:40:41.442
Where are you?

374
00:40:42.542 --> 00:40:43.542
Who are you?

375
00:40:43.942 --> 00:40:44.942
How did you get in here?

376
00:40:48.442 --> 00:40:50.975
We're college students...

377
00:40:51.808 --> 00:40:53.175
Please help us!

378
00:40:53.842 --> 00:40:55.442
We can't find the exit!

379
00:40:56.408 --> 00:40:59.358
There are monsters!
No, ghosts!

380
00:40:59.442 --> 00:41:01.108
Find somewhere to hide!

381
00:41:02.075 --> 00:41:03.275
You could die!

382
00:42:34.908 --> 00:42:37.508
Room 304, Na Sun-hee
and Na Hyun-jung...

383
00:42:38.242 --> 00:42:40.608
How did a restligeist leave
where they died.

384
00:42:44.108 --> 00:42:45.942
Goddammit!

385
00:43:44.442 --> 00:43:46.775
Na Sun-hee, born in 1965.

386
00:43:48.675 --> 00:43:49.675
Right?

387
00:43:52.408 --> 00:43:53.708
Or Na Hyun-jung?

388
00:44:04.042 --> 00:44:05.042
Here.

389
00:44:21.208 --> 00:44:22.475
I want to leave.

390
00:44:36.708 --> 00:44:37.742
Na Hyun-jung.

391
00:44:42.875 --> 00:44:45.442
I'm not Na Hyun-jung.

392
00:44:49.842 --> 00:44:51.275
Then who are you?

393
00:44:54.908 --> 00:44:56.108
Yoon Mi-rin.

394
00:44:58.775 --> 00:45:00.242
Yoon Mi-rin?

395
00:45:05.675 --> 00:45:06.675
All right.

396
00:45:10.308 --> 00:45:12.108
I don't know who you are,

397
00:45:17.175 --> 00:45:19.208
but a restligeist can't be here.

398
00:45:32.542 --> 00:45:33.542
Yoon Mi-rin!

399
00:47:18.875 --> 00:47:20.558
Just run!

400
00:47:20.642 --> 00:47:21.791
What's that black thing?

401
00:47:21.875 --> 00:47:24.424
Shut the heck up and run!
We have to get out of here!

402
00:47:24.508 --> 00:47:25.942
Damn!

403
00:47:27.342 --> 00:47:30.391
It's the same place!
Same hallway!

404
00:47:30.475 --> 00:47:32.558
We ran down here,
but we're in 2nd floor again!

405
00:47:32.642 --> 00:47:35.342
Just go!

406
00:47:37.142 --> 00:47:38.975
Goddamn! 2nd floor again!

407
00:47:46.575 --> 00:47:47.775
Won-jae, get the heck up!

408
00:47:57.708 --> 00:48:00.142
Born in 1976...

409
00:48:02.042 --> 00:48:03.091
Yoon Mi-rin...

410
00:48:03.175 --> 00:48:05.075
(Missing Child)

411
00:48:17.942 --> 00:48:18.942
First floor!

412
00:48:28.042 --> 00:48:29.808
What?

413
00:48:30.342 --> 00:48:31.375
There's no door...

414
00:48:32.742 --> 00:48:34.342
The damn door is gone!

415
00:48:47.208 --> 00:48:48.975
There was one right here.

416
00:48:50.708 --> 00:48:53.908
These glyphs weren't here
when we came in.

417
00:48:55.742 --> 00:48:57.291
We... will...

418
00:48:57.375 --> 00:49:00.524
all die here...

419
00:49:00.608 --> 00:49:02.575
Shut your damn mouth!

420
00:49:03.008 --> 00:49:04.824
I told you we should leave!

421
00:49:04.908 --> 00:49:06.724
You didn't listen to me then...

422
00:49:06.808 --> 00:49:08.342
Hey! Stop it!

423
00:49:15.042 --> 00:49:16.042
The roof.

424
00:49:17.442 --> 00:49:18.442
Let's get to the roof.

425
00:49:19.742 --> 00:49:21.371
Jump off or whatever,

426
00:49:21.700 --> 00:49:22.775
there will be a way.

427
00:50:59.008 --> 00:51:02.242
You stupid idiot...

428
00:52:55.042 --> 00:52:56.042
Mom!

429
00:52:56.908 --> 00:52:59.042
Mom! Mom!

430
00:53:18.842 --> 00:53:20.242
You scum...

431
00:53:29.442 --> 00:53:30.475
You can't go!

432
00:53:31.942 --> 00:53:34.342
If you go now, you'll die.

433
00:53:47.042 --> 00:53:49.108
Come with me, please!

434
00:53:52.708 --> 00:53:53.708
Hurry!

435
00:54:21.042 --> 00:54:22.042
It's Kim Seok-ho!

436
00:54:23.042 --> 00:54:24.942
It was definitely Kim Seok-ho!

437
00:54:25.575 --> 00:54:26.575
Hey!

438
00:54:28.075 --> 00:54:30.524
It'd be better to hide
until the sunrise.

439
00:54:30.608 --> 00:54:32.175
Wherever we go, it's the same...

440
00:54:38.075 --> 00:54:40.158
The door opened by itself...

441
00:54:40.242 --> 00:54:42.442
Where is this voice coming from?

442
00:54:44.275 --> 00:54:45.275
Mister.

443
00:54:47.575 --> 00:54:48.575
Hurry.

444
00:54:51.042 --> 00:54:52.042
Who is that?

445
00:54:54.975 --> 00:54:56.135
Hye-young, what are you doing?

446
00:54:56.208 --> 00:54:57.675
Hye-young! Hye-young!

447
00:54:59.442 --> 00:55:00.442
Hye-young!

448
00:55:00.875 --> 00:55:02.308
Won-jae, what are you doing?

449
00:55:04.875 --> 00:55:05.942
Hye-young!

450
00:55:15.608 --> 00:55:17.475
Mom! Mom!

451
00:55:19.875 --> 00:55:21.342
Won-jae!

452
00:55:35.542 --> 00:55:36.608
Where am I?

453
00:55:41.008 --> 00:55:43.808
Won-jae! Tae-hoon!

454
00:56:24.642 --> 00:56:28.142
Yoon Mi-rin went missing
in 1990...

455
00:56:33.208 --> 00:56:34.642
That's you, right?

456
00:56:36.342 --> 00:56:40.075
I didn't go missing.

457
00:56:41.008 --> 00:56:42.008
What?

458
00:56:43.608 --> 00:56:44.608
I was...

459
00:56:46.875 --> 00:56:48.608
always here.

460
00:56:51.708 --> 00:56:54.458
It wasn't me, it wasn't me!

461
00:56:54.542 --> 00:56:55.558
Shut up!

462
00:56:55.642 --> 00:56:57.724
Where did this
crazy wench come from?

463
00:56:57.808 --> 00:57:00.108
It wasn't me, she did it!

464
00:57:00.808 --> 00:57:02.808
It wasn't me!

465
00:57:03.908 --> 00:57:05.708
It wasn't me!

466
00:57:06.142 --> 00:57:07.508
Dad!

467
00:57:08.008 --> 00:57:09.575
Please!

468
00:57:10.808 --> 00:57:12.308
No!

469
00:57:13.775 --> 00:57:15.458
Dad!

470
00:57:15.542 --> 00:57:17.242
Dad! I'm sorry!

471
00:57:29.742 --> 00:57:31.808
If you hit me again...

472
00:57:35.042 --> 00:57:37.308
I'll kill you first.

473
00:57:48.608 --> 00:57:51.324
The missing case of Yoon Mi-rin,

474
00:57:51.408 --> 00:57:52.758
who went missing last August

475
00:57:52.842 --> 00:57:55.224
is at a standstill for
several months.

476
00:57:55.308 --> 00:57:56.824
The police are unable to rely on

477
00:57:56.908 --> 00:57:59.858
testimonies of the parents,

478
00:57:59.942 --> 00:58:02.124
and will expand the search
nationwide.

479
00:58:02.208 --> 00:58:04.824
Yoon is said to suffer

480
00:58:04.908 --> 00:58:06.624
from Multiple Personality
Disorder,

481
00:58:06.708 --> 00:58:08.742
and that she needs...

482
00:58:30.008 --> 00:58:32.591
Free me at once!

483
00:58:32.675 --> 00:58:34.775
I'll kill you all!

484
00:59:38.475 --> 00:59:42.342
Multiple Personality Disorder...

485
00:59:44.275 --> 00:59:46.908
(MPD ghost is here)

486
00:59:50.075 --> 00:59:53.542
The one in control of
this place isn't Kim...

487
00:59:54.942 --> 00:59:56.308
(Kill Kill)

488
00:59:58.008 --> 00:59:59.675
It's another you.

489
01:00:01.875 --> 01:00:05.475
The other you is
controlling him to kill.

490
01:00:07.608 --> 01:00:10.775
From that night in 1990 on...

491
01:00:13.975 --> 01:00:16.108
you killed everyone
who came here...

492
01:00:32.808 --> 01:00:35.458
- Kill, just kill...
- No!

493
01:00:35.542 --> 01:00:37.158
It wasn't me!

494
01:00:37.242 --> 01:00:38.891
No, no...

495
01:00:38.975 --> 01:00:40.442
I can make this go away.

496
01:00:42.542 --> 01:00:44.842
You want to flee from her, no?

497
01:00:45.342 --> 01:00:47.308
No... no...

498
01:00:47.708 --> 01:00:50.675
She shouldn't be messed with...

499
01:00:51.342 --> 01:00:53.491
- No...
- It's okay, Mi-rin.

500
01:00:53.575 --> 01:00:55.391
That girl hiding inside you.

501
01:00:55.475 --> 01:00:56.675
What's her name?

502
01:00:57.742 --> 01:00:58.742
This will be all over

503
01:00:58.789 --> 01:01:00.042
when she's gone.

504
01:01:01.542 --> 01:01:02.942
Her name is...

505
01:01:03.308 --> 01:01:04.442
Kim...

506
01:01:08.408 --> 01:01:12.842
Kim Yoo...

507
01:01:13.742 --> 01:01:15.008
No.

508
01:01:15.908 --> 01:01:16.908
No...

509
01:01:17.742 --> 01:01:19.124
Tell me again, what did you say?

510
01:01:19.208 --> 01:01:20.275
What's her name?

511
01:01:23.242 --> 01:01:24.542
Tell me!

512
01:01:48.542 --> 01:01:51.062
Something's wrong in the first
place. I have to get out of here!

513
01:02:53.775 --> 01:02:56.975
Name and birth year.

514
01:03:02.575 --> 01:03:04.208
Hong Hye-young...

515
01:03:07.542 --> 01:03:09.308
born in 1975...

516
01:03:11.142 --> 01:03:14.808
1975, Hong Hye-young.

517
01:03:19.608 --> 01:03:21.075
What are you doing?

518
01:03:24.208 --> 01:03:25.642
You okay?

519
01:03:27.475 --> 01:03:28.475
What the heck...

520
01:03:29.575 --> 01:03:30.358
I'll kill you all!

521
01:03:30.442 --> 01:03:31.742
Wait! Stop!

522
01:03:40.842 --> 01:03:46.408
Sir, you're human, right?

523
01:03:50.542 --> 01:03:52.875
Stupid punks...

524
01:03:53.908 --> 01:03:55.108
It was you?

525
01:03:56.575 --> 01:03:57.575
Sir!

526
01:03:57.775 --> 01:03:58.775
Lower your voice.

527
01:04:00.242 --> 01:04:03.042
Why did you kids
come in here for?

528
01:04:03.608 --> 01:04:04.808
You got a death wish?

529
01:04:06.608 --> 01:04:08.208
I know, really.

530
01:04:08.775 --> 01:04:10.542
You can help us, right?

531
01:04:11.142 --> 01:04:13.242
Can't you help us
find our friend?

532
01:04:13.808 --> 01:04:15.242
What for?

533
01:04:15.875 --> 01:04:16.888
If they took him away,

534
01:04:16.972 --> 01:04:18.075
he's a goner.

535
01:04:20.442 --> 01:04:21.808
They?

536
01:04:26.942 --> 01:04:28.208
Would you even understand?

537
01:04:29.708 --> 01:04:31.191
Instead of finding him,

538
01:04:31.275 --> 01:04:32.891
worry about getting out of here.

539
01:04:32.975 --> 01:04:33.975
Hold up.

540
01:04:36.275 --> 01:04:37.308
Look in front of you.

541
01:04:39.508 --> 01:04:42.375
All walls.

542
01:04:47.175 --> 01:04:49.758
No way.
I got out of Guimoon already.

543
01:04:49.842 --> 01:04:50.975
No, that can't be.

544
01:04:51.242 --> 01:04:54.024
There was a door
when we came down here!

545
01:04:54.108 --> 01:04:55.442
Goddammit!

546
01:04:57.808 --> 01:04:58.908
Something's messed up.

547
01:04:59.808 --> 01:05:00.842
We have to hurry.

548
01:05:01.308 --> 01:05:02.308
Hurry!

549
01:05:10.142 --> 01:05:12.191
I came back to the building,

550
01:05:12.275 --> 01:05:13.858
but now the dimension has changed.

551
01:05:13.942 --> 01:05:15.724
- We're here!
- Damn!

552
01:05:15.808 --> 01:05:17.391
Please! Help us!

553
01:05:17.475 --> 01:05:18.942
- Won-jae?
- Open this door!

554
01:05:54.308 --> 01:05:55.808
Won-jae, Lee Won-jae!

555
01:05:56.675 --> 01:05:58.742
Do you want to die?
That's a bait.

556
01:06:01.775 --> 01:06:03.891
If you approach him,
you'll end up like him.

557
01:06:03.975 --> 01:06:04.975
He's right.

558
01:06:06.175 --> 01:06:07.442
Our lives come first.

559
01:06:07.875 --> 01:06:10.391
Tae-hoon, are you nuts?

560
01:06:10.475 --> 01:06:11.775
He said Won-jae's dead!

561
01:06:16.108 --> 01:06:17.275
Won-jae's dead.

562
